606
00:24:35,240 --> 00:24:36,759
You don't treat me as your own.

607
00:24:38,160 --> 00:24:39,880
This makes me uncomfortable.

608
00:24:40,240 --> 00:24:41,240
I can't accept it.

609
00:24:45,559 --> 00:24:46,759
I was wrong.

610
00:24:47,839 --> 00:24:48,359
Dad.

611
00:24:49,519 --> 00:24:50,200
I'm sorry.

612
00:24:50,839 --> 00:24:52,119
I'm afraid that you...

613
00:24:52,920 --> 00:24:53,519
Enough.

614
00:24:55,599 --> 00:24:56,240
Let it go.

615
00:24:57,119 --> 00:24:57,759
Okay?

616
00:24:58,480 --> 00:24:59,839
I'm not here

617
00:24:59,839 --> 00:25:01,000
to lecture you.

618
00:25:02,480 --> 00:25:04,119
Since you like basketball

619
00:25:04,119 --> 00:25:05,680
and are talented in it,

620
00:25:06,680 --> 00:25:08,160
I'll fully support you.

621
00:25:09,200 --> 00:25:10,200
Then we are

622
00:25:11,000 --> 00:25:12,119
still best partners.

623
00:25:13,759 --> 00:25:14,319
OK.

624
00:25:16,799 --> 00:25:18,319
Don't be so happy.

625
00:25:19,880 --> 00:25:21,279
Except for basketball,

626
00:25:21,640 --> 00:25:22,640
