629
00:25:28,160 --> 00:25:30,039
I'll report to you as usual every week.

630
00:25:31,920 --> 00:25:32,759
Don't say report,

631
00:25:34,559 --> 00:25:35,240
it's exchange.

632
00:25:36,119 --> 00:25:37,519
Exchange between friends.

633
00:25:38,440 --> 00:25:38,960
Right.

634
00:25:39,440 --> 00:25:40,039
Friends.

635
00:25:40,519 --> 00:25:41,200
Exchange.

636
00:25:41,400 --> 00:25:42,000
Right.

637
00:25:43,119 --> 00:25:44,119
It's a deal.

638
00:25:45,720 --> 00:25:46,559
It's a deal.
